---
// Radice del sito: manda alla lingua scelta in passato (selettore lingua), altrimenti alla prima lingua
// del browser tra italiano, tedesco e inglese; per tutte le altre lingue l'inglese.
// Senza JavaScript il meta refresh porta a /it/ (il pubblico principale è locale).
const site = Astro.site!.toString().replace(/\/$/, '');
const title = 'Car Trade Bolzano · Revisione, officina, carrozzeria';
const description = 'Revisione DEKRA, officina meccanica, carrozzeria e cambio gomme in un’unica sede a Bolzano Sud, Via Werner von Siemens 4/F.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${site}/it/`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="it" href={`${site}/it/`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="de" href={`${site}/de/`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href={`${site}/en/`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href={`${site}/en/`} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon-96.png" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
    <!-- Anteprima per chi condivide solo "cartradebz.com" (WhatsApp, Facebook, chat): non segue il redirect -->
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Car Trade Bolzano" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="it_IT" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={`${site}/`} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={`${site}/og/copertina-it.jpg`} />
    <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content={`${site}/og/copertina-it.jpg`} />
    <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/jpeg" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={`${site}/og/copertina-it.jpg`} />
    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var ok = { it: 1, de: 1, en: 1 };
        var pick = null;
        try { var saved = localStorage.getItem('ct-lang'); if (ok[saved]) pick = saved; } catch (e) {}
        var prefs = navigator.languages && navigator.languages.length ? navigator.languages : [navigator.language || ''];
        for (var i = 0; i < prefs.length && !pick; i++) {
          var code = String(prefs[i]).slice(0, 2).toLowerCase();
          if (ok[code]) pick = code;
        }
        try { sessionStorage.setItem('ct-entry', '1'); } catch (e) {}
        location.replace('/' + (pick || 'en') + '/');
      })();
    </script>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/it/" />
    <style>body{background:#F7F6F3;color:#0E2340;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh;margin:0}}
</style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><a href="/it/">Italiano</a> · <a href="/de/" lang="de">Deutsch</a> · <a href="/en/" lang="en">English</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
